            {
                "entry_id": "8c23c5ca-e873-343d-a68e-4daa73f32754",
                "word": "country",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "0351cbc2-d4b9-41b5-8c89-bb191bc56121",
                        "entry_id": "8c23c5ca-e873-343d-a68e-4daa73f32754",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "countrys"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1a867282-8023-3a90-a6e8-e695b0abf617",
                        "entry_id": "8c23c5ca-e873-343d-a68e-4daa73f32754",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Style de musique étatsunien à la rythmique traînante, sentimentale ou émouvante."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7bcbba1c-40ea-437d-a939-4cdd626710f8",
                                "sense_id": "1a867282-8023-3a90-a6e8-e695b0abf617",
                                "text": "La country a pour origine les musiques folkloriques celtes et gospel des immigrés anglo-saxons."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "21f4e4ce-a25d-4935-b6b1-7ba5b652bdd3",
                                "sense_id": "1a867282-8023-3a90-a6e8-e695b0abf617",
                                "text": "La country, avec le blues et le rhythm and blues noirs, a contribué en grande partie dans la musique populaire contemporaine, notamment le rock."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "db06fa6a-40cb-4a0e-9570-1f32d93c4612",
                                "sense_id": "1a867282-8023-3a90-a6e8-e695b0abf617",
                                "text": "Et sur la radio on entendait la musique country avec son twang indéfinissable et nostalgique et qui devait me hanter durant de longues années, parce que je l’associerais toujours au ruban des routes qui défilent et à la plongée permanente dans l’inconnu, la nuit, l’aventure, la nuit."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f17191a9-2db3-4b96-85b7-7360d2e22e97",
                        "source_entry_id": "8c23c5ca-e873-343d-a68e-4daa73f32754",
                        "source_sense_id": "1a867282-8023-3a90-a6e8-e695b0abf617",
                        "target_lang_word": "country",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "country",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d18060a5-4189-3bea-aa4e-431fad7e53e9",
                                        "entry_id": "1547b9bf-9dc9-3be1-9a31-905f684241ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The territory of a nation; a sovereign state or a region once independent and still distinct in institutions, language, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2629744-ebb0-4baa-b073-208dcfd7c0ba",
                                                "sense_id": "d18060a5-4189-3bea-aa4e-431fad7e53e9",
                                                "text": "By one o'clock the place was choc-a-bloc. […] The restaurant was packed, and the promenade between the two main courts and the subsidiary courts was thronged with healthy-looking youngish people, drawn to the Mecca of tennis from all parts of the country."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b731a730-0009-4bfb-82f4-a7347a981cc5",
                                                "sense_id": "d18060a5-4189-3bea-aa4e-431fad7e53e9",
                                                "text": "But that expropriation of the Third World, [that] has been going on for 400 years, brings us to another revelation: namely, that the Third World is not poor. You don't go to poor countries to make money. There are very few poor countries in this world. Most countries are rich: the Philippines are rich, Brazil is rich, Mexico is rich, Chile is rich; only the people are poor. But there's billions to be made there, to be carved out, and to be taken; there's been billions for 400 years! The Capitalist European and North American powers have carved out and taken the timber, the flax, the hemp, the cocoa, the rum, the tin, the copper, the iron, the rubber, the bauxite, the slaves, and the cheap labour. They have taken out of these countries. These countries are not underdeveloped; they're overexploited!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ba2943e-0f6e-4de1-97fb-0ea1ec7bd40b",
                                                "sense_id": "d18060a5-4189-3bea-aa4e-431fad7e53e9",
                                                "text": "It is a beautiful country of rolling hills, fertile valleys, and a thousand rivers and streams which keep the landscape green even in winter."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25d0c337-62d1-436d-b788-88714c122f30",
                                                "sense_id": "d18060a5-4189-3bea-aa4e-431fad7e53e9",
                                                "text": "These days corporate Germany looks rather different. Volkswagen, the country’s leading carmaker, wants to be the world’s biggest by 2018."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2dd1a720-2de0-4cf4-a956-c7f3ec64d5ae",
                                                "sense_id": "d18060a5-4189-3bea-aa4e-431fad7e53e9",
                                                "text": "The ability to shift profits to low-tax countries by locating intellectual property in them, which is then licensed to related businesses in high-tax countries, is often assumed to be the preserve of high-tech companies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe34bfb1-4d2a-483c-803f-0734cde8f799",
                                                "sense_id": "d18060a5-4189-3bea-aa4e-431fad7e53e9",
                                                "text": "Most foreigners who have heard of Bhutan know two things: the country charges international visitors a $100/day sustainable development fee (aka tourist tax), and that it is the birthplace of the Gross National Happiness Index, a system intended to look after the well-being of citizens and the environment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c7eb2079-94d4-3808-a613-56e938b259b3",
                                        "entry_id": "1547b9bf-9dc9-3be1-9a31-905f684241ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An area of land of undefined extent; a region, a district."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "British",
                                            "countable",
                                            "especially",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a65df80f-1053-461f-a816-f7acd05fe69f",
                                                "sense_id": "c7eb2079-94d4-3808-a613-56e938b259b3",
                                                "text": "We walk along flat, open country, red dirt and spinifex grass, a few short trees[…]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2b606c43-d47a-38cf-8fb4-f7402142fb10",
                                        "entry_id": "1547b9bf-9dc9-3be1-9a31-905f684241ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An area of land of undefined extent; a region, a district.",
                                            "An area of land of indefinite extent or of more or less definite extent in relation to human occupation, especially characterized by its particular physical features, or its suitability for a particular activity or connected with its population (by race, dialect, culture, etc.) or a person, especially a writer, or their works."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "British",
                                            "countable",
                                            "especially",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e04bd07f-dc0b-4745-8f09-3b6fd047e0d1",
                                                "sense_id": "2b606c43-d47a-38cf-8fb4-f7402142fb10",
                                                "text": "Thomas Hardy country"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17de02bc-9577-40e6-bce5-af365f7b15e4",
                                                "sense_id": "2b606c43-d47a-38cf-8fb4-f7402142fb10",
                                                "text": "Hikers love the wild country that lies northwest of this river confluence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b8fe260-493d-4940-bbf9-71123804250d",
                                                "sense_id": "2b606c43-d47a-38cf-8fb4-f7402142fb10",
                                                "text": "This is condor country – the only region this far east where you can see the magnificent vulture – and a small national park straddling the passes, El Condorito, is a good stopover for walkers and birders."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2952ba35-9f82-3caf-a8d7-02deeeae091b",
                                        "entry_id": "1547b9bf-9dc9-3be1-9a31-905f684241ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A rural area, as opposed to a town or city; the countryside."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f43c4ac-e7ba-4d3a-971a-cd609fa2e4bc",
                                                "sense_id": "2952ba35-9f82-3caf-a8d7-02deeeae091b",
                                                "text": "I was borne and brought up in the Countrie, and amidst husbandry[…]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2084b533-9677-4304-a4ad-67109de15e48",
                                                "sense_id": "2952ba35-9f82-3caf-a8d7-02deeeae091b",
                                                "text": "I have always thought that one of the main reasons for the popularity of blood sports in the country is the pointlessness of going outdoors with no purpose or destination in mind."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46c867a6-5948-4ed4-9031-609f6791e5ab",
                                                "sense_id": "2952ba35-9f82-3caf-a8d7-02deeeae091b",
                                                "text": "She grew up in Chang-hua, a city in central Taiwan with a decidedly country flavor."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7bb6b9e5-b694-3e1b-91b8-3bda9f0d93d6",
                                        "entry_id": "1547b9bf-9dc9-3be1-9a31-905f684241ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The inhabitants or people of a district, region, or nation; the populace, the public."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a126803-c970-4209-86da-8d40d5d74e3b",
                                                "sense_id": "7bb6b9e5-b694-3e1b-91b8-3bda9f0d93d6",
                                                "text": "For all the country, in a general voice,\nCried hate upon him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b4ede587-33cc-354e-a3ba-5a4171fb0eb6",
                                        "entry_id": "1547b9bf-9dc9-3be1-9a31-905f684241ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Traditional lands of Indigenous people with embedded cultural, spiritual, cosmological, ecological, and physical attributes and values."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Australia",
                                            "capitalized",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8fb599cf-15cc-4c28-ab7e-be4e9ca1e4bf",
                                                "sense_id": "b4ede587-33cc-354e-a3ba-5a4171fb0eb6",
                                                "text": "\"Me like my country — no much too hot, no much too cold. By and bye, white fellow come — soldier-man come. White fellow say, this our land, that our land — ALL country our land. Black fellow say no! my country no white fellow's country, and black fellow take spear."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "72d9dcf7-7f36-4e11-97da-7f5302282317",
                                                "sense_id": "b4ede587-33cc-354e-a3ba-5a4171fb0eb6",
                                                "text": "\"Yewi,\" he said, \"me bin longa Fanny Bay gaol five years.\" On my asking why they put him in gaol he replied. \"Australia your country, ain't it?\" I replied, \"Yes, him my country all right.\" \"Well,\" he then said, \"this my country here. Brinken country other side of the river ain't it?\" \"That's right,\" said I. \"Well,\" said Jack, \"supposem Japanese come longa this country and you killem, you good man, but suppose Brinken come longa my country here, and I kill him, police man put me longa Fanny Bay for five years. That is the law.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "863b7bdd-a4c8-4942-84e5-b8dc5ebe07e2",
                                                "sense_id": "b4ede587-33cc-354e-a3ba-5a4171fb0eb6",
                                                "text": "\"It demonstrates that having Indigenous people on country managing their lands, delivering environmental benefits for all Australians is an important asset for the national good.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a748b82c-c9c9-406f-afbb-e8f629977b11",
                                                "sense_id": "b4ede587-33cc-354e-a3ba-5a4171fb0eb6",
                                                "text": "Milgin says living on country, with elders, makes Aboriginal people \"strong\". That's backed up by a 2011 report on Aboriginal homelands by Amnesty International that found that living on homelands was connected to better health outcomes and drug rehabilitation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2d9fafc-5013-4ac8-9546-da003322d7d9",
                                                "sense_id": "b4ede587-33cc-354e-a3ba-5a4171fb0eb6",
                                                "text": "What country do you live/work on? I work on Yuggera Yuggarapul country and I'm from Darwin, Larrakia country."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba6eb393-cf7c-3960-b050-374f3e283087",
                                        "entry_id": "1547b9bf-9dc9-3be1-9a31-905f684241ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ellipsis of country music."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "countable",
                                            "ellipsis",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cebebdd5-9e63-4d97-829f-aef2df287c54",
                                                "sense_id": "ba6eb393-cf7c-3960-b050-374f3e283087",
                                                "text": "a country song"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b94ff4b1-bba7-430c-a254-2ba8788be368",
                                                "sense_id": "ba6eb393-cf7c-3960-b050-374f3e283087",
                                                "text": "a country singer"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60a5ebcb-e9f9-422e-8235-2087c5336d4a",
                                                "sense_id": "ba6eb393-cf7c-3960-b050-374f3e283087",
                                                "text": "a country festival"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "abfaff73-58a4-3929-9b5c-1be383386498",
                                        "entry_id": "1547b9bf-9dc9-3be1-9a31-905f684241ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The spirit of the country (rural places): the spirit of country folkways; those folkways."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "informal",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d480aab-5f49-4617-81af-1e0795720de5",
                                                "sense_id": "abfaff73-58a4-3929-9b5c-1be383386498",
                                                "text": "you can take the boy out of the country, but you can't take the country out of the boy"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92ce7e48-e3c8-3945-8b10-26c3afdb3319",
                                        "entry_id": "1547b9bf-9dc9-3be1-9a31-905f684241ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The rock through which a vein of ore or coal runs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "country",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "23edbdbc-91c1-386c-af26-257fa663a3b0",
                                        "entry_id": "2235254e-3819-3dfb-9934-21f693d7519a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "From or in the countryside, connected with it, or typical of it."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a29727d-549b-48c0-bbd6-a0c782bb670f",
                                                "sense_id": "23edbdbc-91c1-386c-af26-257fa663a3b0",
                                                "text": "Things around here are just a little more country than what he's used to."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "610d8801-02cb-453e-958f-f5c918a2b731",
                                                "sense_id": "23edbdbc-91c1-386c-af26-257fa663a3b0",
                                                "text": "When this conversation was repeated in detail within the hearing of the young woman in question, and undoubtedly for his benefit, Mr. Trevor threw shame to the winds and scandalized the Misses Brewster then and there by proclaiming his father to have been a country storekeeper."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f300aac-0e50-3f62-b32d-d4823c31d9a0",
                                        "entry_id": "2235254e-3819-3dfb-9934-21f693d7519a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or connected to country music."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4410a579-2919-418b-88d1-c492410c8de7",
                                                "sense_id": "8f300aac-0e50-3f62-b32d-d4823c31d9a0",
                                                "text": "They're mainly a hard rock band, but their new album sounds kinda country to me."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d248f626-6ba8-3a28-9cbc-75c7d190ae1f",
                                        "entry_id": "2235254e-3819-3dfb-9934-21f693d7519a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Originating in India rather than being imported from abroad."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "India",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be0262be-02a2-48e5-84af-a41c4f6268be",
                                                "sense_id": "d248f626-6ba8-3a28-9cbc-75c7d190ae1f",
                                                "text": "We have seen that the Company manufactured silk stuffs at three of its Residencies, but from country-wound silk."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07211b6a-1b2d-476e-b8bd-ba4e3a8506ee",
                                                "sense_id": "d248f626-6ba8-3a28-9cbc-75c7d190ae1f",
                                                "text": "A reference to the Annual Administration Reports of the Department of Horse-breeding Operations […] will allow of the opinion being arrived at, that the breed of country horses under the present regime is steadily improving."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae7ebb77-9329-4f81-94e0-c4130095aee7",
                                                "sense_id": "d248f626-6ba8-3a28-9cbc-75c7d190ae1f",
                                                "text": "Country harness costs nearly as much, lasts half the time, and is in every respect inferior. It is understood that the only reason is that the Court desires to improve and encourage Indian manufactures."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
